1
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:02,200
Being the Boss

2
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,200
You know better than anyone I'm not cut out for it

3
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,799
and I don't want it either

4
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,359
But this drink,

5
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,319
I definitely have to drink it

6
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:13,040
because a brother poured it for me

7
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,239
Ah Hong

8
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,560
Can we just let the flower shop matter go?

9
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,719
Consider it a favor to me.

10
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:32,280
Don't give that father and daughter a hard time.

11
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:38,280
Uncle Xiang watched us grow up.

12
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,640
I can let the flower shop thing go.

13
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,439
But other matters...

14
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:44,120
Other matters have nothing to do with me.

15
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,920
I only care about the Lucky Flower Shop.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,760
You hear me?

17
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,760
You hear me?

18
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:57,400
Yeah, yeah, I hear you.

19
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,959
But then again...

20
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:06,280
I've never seen you care so much

21
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,640
about anything else.

22
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,759
Chasing a girl, huh?

23
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,280
I work at that flower shop, you know.

24
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,680
Of course I've got to take it seriously.

25
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,199
But that girl at the flower shop...

26
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,759
seems like she's not married yet.

27
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:18,879
Interested, are you?

28
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,960
We're the same age.

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,599
My son's already this big.

30
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,199
That little brat's got no manners,

31
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,800
calling you Brother Qiang.

32
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,240
Why don't you hurry up and have a kid?

33
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,400
Come on, don't say that.

34
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,840
I've got to get back to work in a bit.

35
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,319
That's it for now.

36
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:42,800
I'm heading off.

37
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,120
Hey.

38
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,439
Come see me when you're free.

39
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,080
Brother Hong.

40
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,280
You let the land matter go.

41
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:11,319
And dropping the little bartender's debt too?

42
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:27,400
Come on

43
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,479
You pay your debts.

44
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,919
It's only right and proper.

45
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,280
Don't touch the flowers with your hands.

46
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,080
What's the problem?

47
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,080
Hold them by the stems.

48
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,840
Hello, Brother Qiang.

49
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:51,879
You're back.

50
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,199
You've met before.

51
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,639
Xiao Qi, my student.

52
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,199
His father's sick.

53
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,199
He needs money.

54
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:59,879
When he's free, he helps out at the flower shop.

55
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,319
If there's anything you don't get, ask Brother Qiang.

56
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,000
Okay.

57
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:04,719
Hello.

58
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,159
I'll go help Uncle Xiang inside.

59
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,039
Where've you been? You're all sweaty.

60
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:12,879
Come here.

61
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:15,919
Thank you.

62
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,160
What's that?

63
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,879
Nothing.

64
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,759
Nothing.

65
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,560
Drink plenty of water when you go inside.

66
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,240
Sis Danni.

67
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,879
What's going on?

68
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,240
Mind your own business.

69
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:38,000
Have you learned everything you need to?

70
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,519
You'll have to learn it sooner or later.

71
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,319
Get to work.

72
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:44,519
I'll go inside and help Uncle Xiang.

73
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:56,360
Happy birthday to you.

74
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:57,600
Happy birthday.

75
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,120
I already told you all.

76
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,399
Don't bother with all this.

77
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:01,920
Of course we do!

78
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,879
A birthday's got to be lively and fun.

79
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:05,920
Happy birthday.

80
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:07,920
There's a gift too.

81
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,360
Yeah.

82
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,279
So nice of you.

83
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:13,120
What is it?

84
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,160
Take a look.

85
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,680
This is...

86
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:22,279
Have a look.

87
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:30,879
Why isn't it moving?

88
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,120
They said it sings the birthday song.

89
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:43,639
Is this...

90
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,399
Store-bought?

91
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:46,800
Yeah.

92
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,600
Bought it at the import shop on the corner.

93
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,639
Eight hundred eighty.

94
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:51,800
Eight hundred eighty?

95
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,279
Brother Qiang, you're a Sucker.

96
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,399
Eight-eighty for this?

97
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,680
Go return it.

98
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:58,160
Once it's given to me, it's mine.

99
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,839
No returns.

100
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:02,439
Whether it's eight-eighty or I'm a Sucker,

101
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,439
we're all together,

102
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,639
happy as can be.

103
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,759
Looks just like A family of four.

104
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,920
Yeah. Brother Qiang, a toast to you.

105
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:12,360
Now you're just being clueless.

106
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,600
"Brother Qiang," huh?

107
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,240
If Ah Qiang here

108
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,279
had married young,

109
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,759
his kids would be this big already.

110
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:19,560
And you keep calling him "Brother Qiang."

111
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,199
Uncle Qiang.

112
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,879
Don't call me Uncle, call me Brother.

113
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,920
Right, right, Brother Qiang.

114
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,879
Brother Qiang, my bad.

115
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,680
I'll be counting on Brother Qiang to look out for me.

116
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,560
Look out for you?

117
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:30,040
Then show some sincerity and get me a bowl of rice.

118
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:30,759
Okay.

119
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:33,920
Oh, right.

120
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,279
Here you go.

121
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:43,040
The birthday girl giving out gifts?

122
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,800
Well, well, how about that.

123
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:50,360
I wore that shirt of yours home the other day,

124
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,519
and noticed it was getting a bit old,

125
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:53,319
so I just bought you a new one.

126
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:07,240
I left that dress of yours at home too.

127
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,600
I'll bring it back for you tomorrow.

128
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:10,120
Okay.

129
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:10,959
Sure.

130
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:16,240
They said the flower shop was short-staffed and hiring.

131
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,480
Turns out they hired a son-in-law.

132
00:07:20,199 --> 00:07:20,959
Uncle Xiang.

133
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,920
Aren't Brother Qiang and I still at the shop?

134
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,120
Are we really short-staffed now?

135
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,519
Let's go.

136
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,240
Have some of this.

137
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,519
Try this.

138
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,319
Since when do we get so polite over dinner?

139
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,120
Right.

140
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,000
Actually...

141
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:47,240
I wanted to tell you something.

142
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,639
Tell me what?

143
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:50,680
It's just, that day...

144
00:07:51,399 --> 00:07:52,839
After you left that night...

145
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:53,639
I kept thinking...

146
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:54,319
I thought about it for a long time.

147
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:55,439
I want to tell you...

148
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:55,800
It's just...

149
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,839
What are you trying to say?

150
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,480
I feel... I feel like I...

151
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,279
You feel like you what?

152
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,720
It's just... I want to...

153
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,319
Are you trying to say I'm really great?

154
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,240
That you're not good enough for me or something?

155
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:15,639
Liang Zhiqiang.

156
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,319
We've slept together.

157
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,439
We've kissed.

158
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:28,639
And now you're spouting all this nonsense?

159
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,440
Don't even think about dumping me.

160
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,559
I'm just gonna have some cake.

161
00:08:41,639 --> 00:08:43,240
Carry on, you two. Carry on.

162
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,240
Say it.

163
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,360
I think you're wonderful, truly wonderful.

164
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,000
And today you look especially beautiful.

165
00:08:57,039 --> 00:09:04,200
Happy birthday to you.

166
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:07,000
It really can... it really can talk!

167
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,240
Right, I told you it can sing the birthday song.

168
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:16,639
Happy birthday to you.

169
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,759
I love it.

170
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,120
Are we still having cake or not?

171
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,320
Don't bother calling them.

172
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:51,879
Officer Chen

173
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,600
The files show that

174
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,600
about a month ago,

175
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:56,120
around August as well,

176
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,679
Xie Guanhong

177
00:09:58,879 --> 00:10:01,720
was detained for 48 hours.

178
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:04,159
Couldn't you find evidence to charge him then?

179
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,600
Which time?

180
00:10:06,679 --> 00:10:07,639
Oh, that time.

181
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:11,279
That was a joint operation too.

182
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,759
Such a shame.

183
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,080
That's right.

184
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:17,159
We nearly had them for good.

185
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,679
So close.

186
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,399
"So close" again.

187
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:24,000
And how close were you this time?

188
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,759
But the file says

189
00:10:27,279 --> 00:10:29,159
he's suspected of premeditated murder.

190
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,559
Xie Guanhong.

191
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,919
You're so hungry for it today.

192
00:10:51,919 --> 00:10:52,759
What's gotten into you?

193
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,240
Trying to drain me dry?

194
00:10:54,919 --> 00:10:56,600
Brother Hong, you have such great stamina.

195
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,600
There's no way I could drain you.

196
00:10:59,159 --> 00:11:01,320
So, it's been a few days.

197
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,960
Did you miss me?

198
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:08,200
You know what?

199
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:09,720
Everything about you is great.

200
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,600
But that mouth of yours...

201
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,799
Sometimes it's just annoying.

202
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:15,919
If I weren't a little annoying,

203
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:19,559
how could I get you to punish me

204
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:22,440
even harder?

205
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,919
You little slut,

206
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:33,279
it just comes so naturally to you.

207
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,639
If I weren't a little slutty,

208
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:38,360
how could I win your affection?

209
00:11:38,679 --> 00:11:42,120
No one knows what you want like I do.

210
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:47,320
But then again,

211
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:50,600
weren't you gonna kill that guy Camel?

212
00:11:51,159 --> 00:11:52,200
No rush.

213
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,440
Really?

214
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,840
No rush.

215
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,639
Someone else is taking point for me.

216
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,440
Why hurry?

217
00:12:01,799 --> 00:12:03,039
So it looks like

218
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:06,600
I'm still your main priority.

219
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,240
Of course you are.

220
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:38,559
Harder.

221
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,159
Come on, put your back into it!

222
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:51,360
Now that's the right amount of force.

223
00:13:52,039 --> 00:13:54,080
A little harder.

224
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,039
Harder.

225
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,879
Feels amazing, doesn't it?

226
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,279
Come on, come on.

227
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,600
Charge!

228
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,039
Why won't you take me along?

229
00:14:41,159 --> 00:14:42,279
You don't take me to fights,

230
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:43,679
you don't take me to deals either.

231
00:14:44,159 --> 00:14:45,360
This time, I really want to see

232
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,840
just where the hell you're going.
